    "title": "Celebrities and Charity: A Good Mix?",
    "description": "Two speakers discuss whether it's a good thing when famous people like actors and singers get involved with charity work. They explore both the positive and negative sides of this popular trend.",
    "duration": "01:28",
    "difficulty": "B2",
    "url": "https://assets.parroto.app/assets/lessons/6a26b34973fb66cc90354160/combined-6a26b34973fb66cc90354160-1780921161510.mp3",
